 to be a license used solely for your own personal projects, and does not have actual, substantial use. See \"Other factor\" 3 in the [License Inclusion Principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md). I see no evidence of its use by anyone else.\n\nThe SPDX License List is not a registry for newly-drafted licenses with no actual, substantial use in the wild. Given that, I am closing this issue. Feel free to re-submit in the future if at some point it does have very substantial and significant uptake.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3741609598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]